# Input

```scss
@use "sass:math";
$unit:px;$gap:2px;
.suppressed-fallbacks {
  width:attr(data-width $unit
    /* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression */
    , $gap*2);
  height:attr(data-height #{$unit}
    /* before directive */
    /* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression */
    // after directive
    , $gap*2);
  min-width:attr(data-width math.$pi
    /* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression */
    , $gap*2);
  max-width:attr(data-width $unit/* before *//* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression *//* after */, $gap*2);
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@use "sass:math";
$unit: px;
$gap: 2px;
.suppressed-fallbacks {
	width: attr(
		data-width
		$unit
		/* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression */
		, $gap*2
	);
	height: attr(
		data-height
		#{$unit}
		/* before directive */
		/* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression */
		// after directive
		, $gap*2
	);
	min-width: attr(
		data-width
		math.$pi
		/* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression */
		, $gap*2
	);
	max-width: attr(
		data-width
		$unit
		/* before */ /* biome-ignore format: preserve the fallback expression */ /* after */ , $gap*2
	);
}

```

